},{
["source"]="DPG:44",
["section"]="Khazalid Glossary: Drakk",
["quote"]="Drakk Dragon",
["claim"]="Drakk supplies only the dragon motif. Applying colour or shine to this symbolic title is a new composition; it does not certify a slaying, trophy, bound creature, dragon-made object, power, or actual engraved design."
},{
["source"]="DPG:45",
["section"]="Khazalid Glossary: Gorl, Grund, Gronti, Gor",
["quote"]="Gronti Giant",
["claim"]="The selected senses are yellow, hammer, giant and wild beast. Gorl does not assign gold material, Grund does not classify the item as a hammer, and creature imagery does not invent a species, deed or animal-derived material."
},{
["source"]="DPG:46",
["section"]="Khazalid Glossary: Klinka",
["quote"]="Klinka Chisel",
