["section"]="Ancestor Veneration / Honouring the Ancestors",
["quote"]="Kolgrund",
["claim"]="The Black Hammer brewing clan is a canonical identity. Its compact name is reserved here as well as globally, rather than used for a generated artifact."
},{
["source"]="DPG:44",
["section"]="Khazalid Glossary: Az, Azul, Baraz",
