["quote"]="Uzkul Bones or death",
["claim"]="Selected new senses are stream, handgun, dense forest, bones, mountain lake, waterfall and upland plateau. Bones is not death; generic wood is not Wutroth, whose glossary sense requires ancient mountain oak."
