["source"]="DPG:43",
["section"]="Khazalid meanings and runic script",
["quote"]="One must consider the context in which it is used",
["claim"]="Every three-part proposal discloses its intended grouping. Appearance modifiers apply to concrete motifs; version-186 additions also associate a symbolic setting or creature emblem with a metal-and-equipment pair. The groupings are reviewed Forthammer compositions, not claims that the book defines these compounds or their grammar."
},{
