["claim"]="Kadrinaz is a canonical place identity. Exclude the complete name and avoid creating coloured variants of it."
},{
["source"]="DPG:43",
["section"]="Khazalid meanings and pictographic/alphabetic runes",
["quote"]="the context in which it is used",
["claim"]="Material-and-equipment and creature-emblem-and-equipment compositions are symbolic adaptations using the selected glossary senses. Their explicit grouping is explanatory metadata, not a rule derived from official Khazalid grammar; item affinities require separate observed facts."
